   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank State and Peacebuilding Fund 2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to enhance and expand the frontiers of Bank engagement in helping countries address the drivers and impacts of fragility, conflict and violence (FCV) and strengthening the resilience of countries and affected populations, communities and institutions. 

Strategic Area of Focus 1: Preventing violent conflict and interpersonal violence.
Strategic Area of Focus 2: Remaining engaged during conflict and crisis situations.
Strategic Area of Focus 3: Helping countries transition out of fragility.
Strategic Area of Focus 4: Mitigating the spillovers of FCV.</narrative>
  </description>
